      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792652200738,
      "created": 1792651892059,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Maintain Simplicity;\n    - Start with the simplest thing.\n    - Prove that complexity earns its keep before you add it\n\n2. Prioritize Transparency;\n    - Make the agent's reasoning visible.\n    - Rely on streaming outputs and traces instead of hidden logic.\n\n3. Craft the Interface;\n    - Good tool descriptions are like docstrings for AI.\n    - A tool's name, description, and parameters are how the model\n       understands it universe.\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Maintain Simplicity;\n    - Start with the simplest thing.\n    - Prove that complexity earns its keep before you add it\n\n2. Prioritize Transparency;\n    - Make the agent's reasoning visible.\n    - Rely on streaming outputs and traces instead of hidden logic.\n\n3. Craft the Interface;\n    - Good tool descriptions are like docstrings for AI.\n    - A tool's name, description, and parameters are how the model\n       understands it universe.\n",
